    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Here, again, the boundary condition is enforced with the L2-integral of the error, U(x;θ) − g(x), and the integrals of the energy term and the boundary condition term are approximated by the Monte–Carlo method; the weight factors wI and wB are analogous to those in the PINN loss."
