    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "As an enhancement to soft enforcement of boundary conditions, an augmented Lagrangian term can be included to the loss function [42] to obtain,"
